flowchart TD
  A[Player action] --> B[Cell button]
  B --> C[Board callback]
  C --> D[Game handler]
  D --> E{Input allowed?}
  E -->|No| F[Feedback or ignore]
  E -->|Yes| G[resolveMove]
  G --> H{Rules result ok?}
  H -->|No| I[Show rejection]
  H -->|Yes| J[Preview cascade if needed]
  J --> K[Lock input]
  K --> L[Commit settled board]
  L --> M[Check winner and next player]
  M --> N[Render updated state]
